    A hA ρ hρ ΛT OT hD hΛ hσT (heckeDiamondInputsHAll (N₀ * p) ⊤) (∅ : Set ℕ) ℓ hTOR σN hσN hUPtor σ hσ hσ.mem_decompositionSubgroup
